    "regime_notes": "The 40-day signal passed the benchmark gates (absolute IC >= 0.0070 and absolute ICIR >= 0.0840). Middle regime 2024-2026: IC 0.062131, ICIR 0.234922 over 103 dates; late regime 2027-2030: IC 0.024189, ICIR 0.091040 over 830 dates. Five-day predictiveness was weak, while the effect strengthened through 40 days. Interpret uncertainty conservatively for the 15-instrument universe.",
